    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A funeral copy of the crown the King wears, buried with a lesser lord of the same house. It turns aside a fair share of hostile magic and the cold that follows it, and it keeps its wearer's mind and life his own -- but the deeper wardings laid on the true crown were never laid on this one."
    }
